       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPTR07.
      * TRUST BENEFICIARY LIST - COUNT PERSONS TO IDENTIFY
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BENEFICIARIES.
           05  WS-BEN-PCT           PIC 9(3)V99 OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       01  WS-IX                     PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TO-IDENTIFY            PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IX > 6
              ACCEPT WS-BEN-PCT (WS-IX)
           END-PERFORM
           PERFORM 2000-SCAN
           DISPLAY 'BENEFICIARIES TO IDENTIFY: ' WS-TO-IDENTIFY
           STOP RUN.
       2000-SCAN.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-TO-IDENTIFY
           PERFORM VARYING WS-IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IX > 6
              IF WS-BEN-PCT (WS-IX) >= 15.00
                 ADD 1 TO WS-TO-IDENTIFY
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
